{"reference":"Jeremiah 19","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":19,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"In the Book of Jeremiah","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Jeremiah 19 belongs to a received book that combines poetry, prose sermons, narratives, letters, headings, repeated accounts, restoration collections, oracles concerning nations, and an appendix. The practical outline often used for the Masoretic form of the book places this chapter within chapters 2–25, but that outline does not settle how the book was composed.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_019_6283973c4092755cc34c490c"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}